{"id":"d4768eaba2d6f60b","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-inner4-acceptable-structure.md","title":"ZFC Inner4 Acceptable Structure","display":"df-zfc-inner4-acceptable-structure — ZFC Inner4 Acceptable Structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner4-acceptable-structure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner4-acceptable-structure"],"display":"df-zfc-inner4-acceptable-structure — ZFC Inner4 Acceptable Structure","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-transitive.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-model7-amenable-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner4-acceptable-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner4-acceptable-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner4-acceptable-structure — ZFC Inner4 Acceptable Structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" href=\"?note=2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md\">../batch13/58-df-transitive.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cbf54d50c77440e3\" href=\"?note=cbf54d50c77440e3\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b356651c233e2470\" href=\"?note=b356651c233e2470\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-model7-amenable-structure.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-model7-amenable-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=\\langle M,\\in,A\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal M=\\langle M,\\in,A\\rangle\\)</span> (set structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Transitive}\">\\(\\mathrm{Transitive}\\)</span> (transitive-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" href=\"?note=2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md\">../batch13/58-df-transitive.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S\\)</span> (rudimentary-closure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cbf54d50c77440e3\" href=\"?note=cbf54d50c77440e3\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7AmenableStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7AmenableStructure}_S\\)</span> (amenability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b356651c233e2470\" href=\"?note=b356651c233e2470\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-model7-amenable-structure.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-model7-amenable-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AcceptableBaseStructure}\">\\(\\operatorname{AcceptableBaseStructure}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}acceptable\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\operatorname{AcceptableBaseStructure}(\\mathcal M,M,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal M=\\langle M,\\in,A\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\\land\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7AmenableStructure}_S(M,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}acceptable\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\operatorname{AcceptableBaseStructure}(\\mathcal M,M,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal M=\\langle M,\\in,A\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\\land\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7AmenableStructure}_S(M,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“Acceptable” here denotes the explicitly stated transitive, rudimentarily closed, amenable base condition. Jensen's stronger fine-structural acceptability requires projecta and definable-surjection machinery not introduced by this atom.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md","status":"resolved","id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-transitive.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"cbf54d50c77440e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-model7-amenable-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"b356651c233e2470","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-model7-amenable-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md","status":"resolved","id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Transitive}$ (transitive-set predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-transitive.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"cbf54d50c77440e3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RudClosedSet}_S$ (rudimentary-closure predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-rud-closed-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-model7-amenable-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"b356651c233e2470","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","loca